WEBVTT

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:32.240
I don't know if
it's going to happen or not.

00:22:32.625 --> 00:22:35.887
But let's say we did extrapolate a bit.

00:22:35.911 --> 00:22:40.490
If you believe the government is benign

00:22:40.514 --> 00:22:44.609
and that people want
the society to be better,

00:22:44.633 --> 00:22:47.879
and that they had a feedback mechanism

00:22:47.903 --> 00:22:50.910
and it were transparent and fair,

00:22:50.934 --> 00:22:53.990
and people knew
that if they did certain things,

00:22:54.014 --> 00:22:57.101
they will be able to get more conveniences

00:22:57.125 --> 00:23:00.228
and more security and more upside.